  "description": "Seon-U’s mother forces him to go on blind dates. But what happens when a handsome and outgoing man shows up instead? Seon-U, who is tired of going on dates, politely rejects Hyeon, the man who is interested in him. However, when his ex-boyfriend’s wedding invitation arrives, Hyeon absurdly tells Seon-U that he’ll help him seek revenge…He’s going to help? How??\n\n“Well, I’m more handsome, cooler, and younger than him. We can just show him how much better off you are with me, right? We can show him that the perfect man is standing right next to you.\"\n\n(Source: BOMTOON, translated)",
